I'm gonna protect you now. Forever.

172
00:15:08,540 --> 00:15:09,370
Shinkawa!

173
00:15:09,500 --> 00:15:10,680
I love you, Asura.

174
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:11,980
You're mine.

175
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:13,480
My Asura.

176
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:17,120
Xenon. Mine.

177
00:15:17,620 --> 00:15:19,660
Let go!

178
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:28,761
Why'd you push me away like that?

179
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,700
You made a promise.

180
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,040
We both did.

181
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:34,930
Shinkawa!

182
00:15:55,180 --> 00:15:57,240
Don't make any sudden moves, Asura.

183
00:15:58,420 --> 00:16:00,497
The syringe I'm holding's got a drug in it

184
