That's one way.

189
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,780
Yeah, it is the family business.

190
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:18,689
I promised my dad I'd go to med
school, so it's a done deal.

191
00:16:18,780 --> 00:16:19,839
Stuck with it now.

192
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:22,160
This is crazy.

193
00:16:23,580 --> 00:16:25,320
You're the other Death Gun.

194
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:29,200
Ooh, I'm impressed.

195
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:32,111
You figured out Death Gun's little secret.

196
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:33,640
It's true.

197
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:36,040
I'm Death Gun's partner in crime.

198
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:42,797
Up to now, before this year's B .O .B.

199
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:45,520
anyway, I was the one playing Shterben.

200
