But today, I insisted on being
the one to do the job IRL.

201
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:52,960
Don't you see?

202
00:16:53,160 --> 00:16:55,017
I had to be the one doing the deed.

203
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:57,177
I can't let some other guy touch you.

204
00:16:57,260 --> 00:16:59,340
Even if that guy's my brother.

205
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:00,980
Your brother?

206
