217
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,260
About my parents?

218
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:34,800
Those guys in school?

219
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,320
They're all assholes!

220
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:39,477
You know what would have made me happy?

221
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:41,417
To be the strongest player in GGO.

222
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:45,820
But that piece of shit Zackseed lied
about AGI-types being the strongest.

223
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:48,600
And I fell for it like an idiot!

224
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:51,100
You don't know.

225
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,380
GGO was everything to me.

226
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:57,540
And I gave everything up in the
real world for it, goddammit!

227
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:02,840
You killed Zackseed because he lied?

228
00:18:03,360 --> 00:18:04,480
Oh, come on.

229
00:18:04,700 --> 00:18:06,229
He was the perfect victim.

230
00:18:06,360 --> 00:18:11,380
We had to show the world Death Gun was
the strongest in GGO and all the VR Miss.

231
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:14,265
What better person to
sacrifice than that dork?

232
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:18,760
And now that that's done, I
don't need this reality anymore.

233
00:18:20,040 --> 00:18:21,900
Let's move on to the next one.

234
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:23,760
Come on, just you and me.

235
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,680
What are you saying?

236
00:18:26,140 --> 00:18:28,120
We can go somewhere like GGO.

237
00:18:29,620 --> 00:18:32,091
No, someplace with a fantasy vibe instead.

238
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:34,674
As long as it's with you, I don't care.

239
00:18:34,940 --> 00:18:37,917
We'll be reborn, be husband
and a wife, we'll get a house.

240
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:41,500
We'll go on quests together,
oh, and have kids, too.

241
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:43,060
It'll be so much fun.

242
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:44,960
I know I will.

243
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:46,200
Come with me.

244
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:50,480
Asuna, you're so beautiful.

245
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:53,240
You are more than anything.

246
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:56,460
You're mine and no one else's.

247
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:59,900
I always loved you, Asuna, always.

248
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:04,840
At school, when I heard about what
happened, when I heard what you did,

249
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:09,000
I could look all over and never
find another girl like you.

250
00:19:09,260 --> 00:19:13,960
I mean, you shot a real bad guy
with a real gun and killed him.

251
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:15,980
How cool is that?

252
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:17,920
I told you, didn't I?

253
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:20,220
I said you had real power.

254
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:24,357
Then I came up with the Death Gun Legend.

255
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:27,205
I picked the Type 54 as
his gun because of you.

256
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:30,340
That's how much I love you, Asuna.

257
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,917
I love you so much.

258
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:34,960
more than anything.

259
00:19:36,740 --> 00:19:37,980
No.

260
00:19:54,580 --> 00:20:01,040
I don't want to see anything
or feel anything anymore.

261
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:05,857
This isn't real.

262
00:20:05,940 --> 00:20:07,060
It can't be.

263
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:17,120
Kirito, you went to all that trouble
to save me, but it was all for nothing.

264
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:19,100
How about this?

265
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:21,909
After we log out, I
could head over to you.

266
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:25,820
If he comes over, he'll be in danger.

267
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:30,380
And I can't do anything about it.

268
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:33,060
That's not true.

269
00:20:35,140 --> 00:20:39,199
Up to this point, all we've been
doing was looking out for ourselves.

270
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:42,200
We certainly never fought for anyone else.

271
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:49,060
But now, even though it might be too late
for us, let's go fight for someone else.

272
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:51,200
Just this once, me and you.

273
00:21:07,780 --> 00:21:09,160
Come on, let's go.

274
00:21:14,060 --> 00:21:16,100
I love you, Asuna.

275
00:21:35,620 --> 00:21:36,540
No!

276
00:21:39,860 --> 00:21:42,080
Let go of me! No!

277
00:21:43,520 --> 00:21:44,350
No!

278
00:21:45,180 --> 00:21:47,020
Asuna! Asuna!

279
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:48,910
Asuna!

280
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:49,990
Asuna!

281
00:21:50,340 --> 00:21:51,300
Asuna! Asuna!

282
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:53,657
Asuna!

283
00:21:53,740 --> 00:21:54,858
Get your head down!

284
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:57,500
Run, Sinon!

285
00:22:45,100 --> 00:22:46,617
I don't need

286
00:22:46,700 --> 00:22:53,400
one more time.

287
00:22:53,660 --> 00:22:57,580
I want to be stronger and stronger.

288
00:22:58,700 --> 00:23:01,220
I want to be in the dark.

289
00:23:36,180 --> 00:23:38,620
Next time, One Little Step
